{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>In that day he shall lean.</b> A man shall lean himself upon HaShem, and this is trust; like it: ישעו ואין מושיע (they trusted and there was no rescuer) (II Samuel 22:42)." "<b>The reason of תראנה.</b> That idolatry shall not be seen again, for one shall go only to the place of glory."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {1 "Text reads מקום; bracketed editorial correction אל מקום reflected in translation as 'to the place.'"}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:06.760597359Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}